<title>ITALY: Bergamo air cargo traffic up 23.7pct in Jan '97.</title>
<headline>Bergamo air cargo traffic up 23.7pct in Jan '97.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bergamo airport carried 3,794 tonnes</p>
<p>of air cargo traffic in January, up 23.7 percent on the 3,067</p>
<p>tonnes carried a year earlier.</p>
<p> Type of traffic	 Jan 97   Jan 96   Pct Change</p>
<p> On line		    490	124     up   295.0pct</p>
<p> Charter		    151	151     unchanged</p>
<p> Cargo couriers	   547	604     down   9.4</p>
<p> All cargo		    0	  4     down 100.0</p>
<p> Other			240	332     down  27.7</p>
<p> Commercial aviation   1448     1215     up    19.2</p>
<p> General aviation	 342	361     down  -5.2</p>
<p> TOTAL All traffic     3794     3067     up    23.7.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 711 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
